+    """One tile's domain -> coarse z, link, kind, cxy (L, CN, CN). tz, tnz, th, wl (DN, DN): the terrain's height,
+    |normal z| and holes and the water level (nan = none); tri_rc (k, 3, 3): the objects' triangles in fine-cell
